IsImRpc3RyaWJ1dG9ySWQiOiI1NmIxZWI5MzQ0ZmVjYTNkZjJlMzIwY2IiLCJhcGlrZXlJZCI6IjU2YjFlZmVlMGNmMjEzYWQyMGRkMjE3MCJ9","attributeIdMultimediaContent":"IMAGE","attributeIdMultimediaContentDescription":"Image","attributeIdSizeOrientation":"16X9","width":"280","height":"158","altText":"girl playing at messy play session","caption":"girl playing at messy play session","photographer":"","copyright":"","sequenceNumber":"200"}],"openTimes":[],"productComments":[{"marketVariantId":"English / Global","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"ENGLISH","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"English","commentText":"Historic Rivermill on the banks of the Coomera River in the Gold Coast Hinterland hosts Messy Play: Dinos and Diggers, a sensory play session for young children presented by Gumtree Kids. \n\nDesigned to encourage creativity, imagination, learning, and play\n\nLittle ones dig, scoop and explore themed messy play stations at their own pace, with materials that are all safe to taste. \n\nMessy play experiences are suitable for children aged 6 months to 5 years, with activities tailored to a range of developmental stages."},{"marketVariantId":"Portuguese","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"PORT-EUR","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Portuguese","commentText":"O histórico Rivermill às margens do rio Coomera, no interior da Gold Coast, recebe o Messy Play: Dinos and Diggers, uma sessão de brincadeiras sensoriais para crianças pequenas, apresentada pela Gumtree Kids.\n\nProjetada para estimular a criatividade, a imaginação, o aprendizado e a brincadeira.\n\nOs pequenos cavam, escavam e exploram estações temáticas de brincadeiras sensoriais no seu próprio ritmo, com materiais que podem ser ingeridos com segurança.\n\nAs experiências de brincadeiras sensoriais são adequadas para crianças de 6 meses a 5 anos, com atividades adaptadas a diferentes estágios de desenvolvimento."},{"marketVariantId":"Chinese Simplified","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"CHINESE-S","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Chinese Simplified","commentText":"位于黄金海岸腹地库梅拉河畔的历史悠久的河畔磨坊（Rivermill）将举办“恐龙与挖掘机：趣味游戏”活动，这是一项由Gumtree Kids呈现的幼儿感官游戏体验活动。\n\n旨在激发孩子的创造力、想象力、学习能力和玩耍热情。\n\n孩子们可以按照自己的节奏，在主题各异的趣味游戏区挖掘、铲取和探索，所有材料均可安全食用。\n\n趣味游戏体验适合6个月至5岁的儿童，活动内容根据不同发展阶段量身定制。"},{"marketVariantId":"German","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"GERMAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"German","commentText":"Die historische Flussmühle am Ufer des Coomera River im Hinterland der Gold Coast lädt zu „Messy Play: Dinos and Diggers“ ein, einem Sinneserlebnis für Kleinkinder, präsentiert von Gumtree Kids.\n\nDas Angebot fördert Kreativität, Fantasie, Lernen und freies Spielen.\n\nDie Kleinen können in ihrem eigenen Tempo an verschiedenen Themenstationen buddeln, schaufeln und die Materialien erkunden, die alle unbedenklich zum Probieren sind.\n\nDas Erlebnis eignet sich für Kinder von 6 Monaten bis 5 Jahren und die Aktivitäten sind auf verschiedene Entwicklungsstufen abgestimmt."},{"marketVariantId":"Indonesian","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"INDONESIAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Indonesian","commentText":"Rivermill yang bersejarah di tepi Sungai Coomera di pedalaman Gold Coast menyelenggarakan Messy Play: Dinos and Diggers, sesi bermain sensorik untuk anak-anak kecil yang dipersembahkan oleh Gumtree Kids.\n\nDirancang untuk mendorong kreativitas, imajinasi, pembelajaran, dan bermain.\n\nAnak-anak kecil menggali, menyendok, dan menjelajahi stasiun bermain kotor bertema sesuai kecepatan mereka sendiri, dengan bahan-bahan yang aman untuk dicicipi.\n\nPengalaman bermain kotor cocok untuk anak-anak berusia 6 bulan hingga 5 tahun, dengan aktivitas yang disesuaikan dengan berbagai tahap perkembangan."},{"marketVariantId":"Italian","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"ITALIAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Italian","commentText":"Lo storico mulino sul fiume Coomera, nell'entroterra della Gold Coast, ospita Messy Play: Dinos and Diggers, una sessione di gioco sensoriale per bambini piccoli presentata da Gumtree Kids.\n\nPensato per stimolare la creatività, l'immaginazione, l'apprendimento e il gioco\n\nI più piccoli scavano, raccolgono e esplorano postazioni di gioco sensoriale a tema, al proprio ritmo, con materiali tutti sicuri da ingerire.\n\nLe esperienze di gioco sensoriale sono adatte a bambini dai 6 mesi ai 5 anni, con attività pensate per diverse fasi di sviluppo."},{"marketVariantId":"Chinese Traditional","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"CHINESE-T","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Chinese Traditional","commentText":"位於黃金海岸腹地庫梅拉河畔的歷史悠久的河畔磨坊（Rivermill）將舉辦「恐龍與挖掘機：趣味遊戲」活動，這是一項由Gumtree Kids呈現的幼兒感官遊戲體驗活動。\n\n旨在激發孩子的創造力、想像、學習能力和玩耍熱情。\n\n孩子們可以按照自己的節奏，在主題各異的趣味遊戲區挖掘、鏟取和探索，所有材料均可安全食用。\n\n趣味遊戲體驗適合6個月至5歲的兒童，活動內容依不同發展階段量身訂做。"},{"marketVariantId":"Spanish","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"SPAN-EUR","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Spanish","commentText":"El histórico molino Rivermill, a orillas del río Coomera en el interior de la Costa Dorada, presenta Messy Play: Dinos and Diggers, una sesión de juego sensorial para niños pequeños organizada por Gumtree Kids.\n\nDiseñado para fomentar la creatividad, la imaginación, el aprendizaje y el juego.\n\nLos más pequeños cavan, recogen y exploran estaciones de juego sensorial temáticas a su propio ritmo, con materiales totalmente seguros para que los prueben.\n\nLas experiencias de juego sensorial son adecuadas para niños de 6 meses a 5 años, con actividades adaptadas a las diferentes etapas de desarrollo."},{"marketVariantId":"Korean","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"KOREAN","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Korean","commentText":"골드코스트 내륙 지역 쿠메라 강변에 위치한 유서 깊은 리버밀에서 검트리 키즈(Gumtree Kids)가 주최하는 어린이를 위한 감각 놀이 프로그램, '메시 플레이: 공룡과 굴착기'가 열립니다.\n\n창의력 상상력 학습 및 놀이를 장려하도록 설계되었습니다.\n\n아이들은 안전하게 맛볼 수 있는 재료들을 사용하여 테마별로 꾸며진 감각 놀이 공간에서 자유롭게 땅을 파고 퍼내고 탐색할 수 있습니다.\n\n이 프로그램은 6개월부터 5세까지의 어린이를 대상으로 하며 다양한 발달 단계에 맞춰 활동이 구성되어 있습니다."},{"marketVariantId":"French","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"FRENCH","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"French","commentText":"Le moulin historique Rivermill, situé sur les rives de la rivière Coomera dans l'arrière-pays de la Gold Coast, accueille « Messy Play : Dinos and Diggers », une séance d'éveil sensoriel pour les jeunes enfants présentée par Gumtree Kids.\n\nConçue pour stimuler la créativité, l'imagination, l'apprentissage et le jeu\n\nles tout-petits peuvent creuser, ramasser et explorer à leur rythme des espaces de jeux sensoriels thématiques, avec des matériaux sans danger pour la dégustation.\n\nCes activités sont adaptées aux enfants de 6 mois à 5 ans et conviennent à différents stades de développement."},{"marketVariantId":"Japanese","attributeIdProductComment":"PRODTRANS ","attributeIdProductCommentDescription":"Product Description Translation","sequenceNumber":"100","attributeIdLanguageWritten":"JAPANESE","attributeIdLanguageWrittenDescription":"Japanese","commentText":"ゴールドコースト内陸部のクーメラ川沿いにある歴史的なリバーミルで、ガムツリーキッズ主催の幼児向け感覚遊びセッション「メッシープレイ：恐竜と掘削機」が開催されます。\n\n創造性、想像力、学習、そして遊びを促すようにデザインされています。\n\n小さなお子様は、テーマに沿ったメッシープレイステーションで、自分のペースで掘ったり、すくったり、探検したりできます。使用する素材はすべて口に入れても安全なものばかりです。\n\nメッシープレイ体験は、生後6ヶ月から5歳までのお子様に適しており、発達段階に合わせたアクティビティが用意されています。"}],"productSite":[{"siteName":"Historic Rivermill","attributeIdSiteType":"VENUE","attributeIdSiteTypeDescription":"Venue","productSiteAddressRelationship":[{"attributeIdAddress":"PHYSICAL","attributeIdAddressDescription":"Physical","addressLine1":"950 Beaudesert Nerang Road","addressLine2":"","suburbName":"","cityName":"Mount Nathan","areaName":"","stateName":"Queensland","countryName":"Australia","addressPostalCode":"4211","overrideDomesticRegionFlag":"0","geocodeGdaLatitude":"-27.9760432","geocodeGdaLongitude":"153.2507233","productSiteAddressStreetDirectoryRelationship":""}],"productSiteAttributeRelationship":"","productSiteCommentRelationship":"","productSiteCommunicationRelationship":"","productSiteLicenceRelationship":"","productSiteRelatedSiteRelationship":"","productSiteMultimediaRelationship":"","productSiteContactRelationship":""}],"mediaLinks":[],"alternateNames":[{"name":"Historic Rivermill","kind":""}],"internationalReach":"","rates":[{"ratesType":"ALLTICKETS","ratesTypeDescription":"All tickets","priceFrom":"20","priceTo":"30","free":"","rateComment":""}],"deals":[],"jobVacancies":[],"weather":"","menuUrl":"","winelistUrl":"","doesServeMeal":"","openingTime":{"openingTimeType":"","seasonalPeriods":[],"openingTimeComment":"","exceptions":{"exceptionPeriod":"","periods":[]}},"productProximity":[],"productWidget":[],"services":[],"verticalClassifications":[{"productTypeId":"EVTCLASS","productTypeDescription":"Classes,